    "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
    "verseCount": 6,
    "content": "<p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"1\" data-sid=\"PSA 150:1\" class=\"v\">1</span>Praise ye the Lord in his holy places: praise ye him in the firmament of his power.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"2\" data-sid=\"PSA 150:2\" class=\"v\">2</span>Praise ye him for his mighty acts: praise ye him according to the multitude of his greatness.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"3\" data-sid=\"PSA 150:3\" class=\"v\">3</span>Praise him with sound of trumpet: praise him with psaltery and harp.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"4\" data-sid=\"PSA 150:4\" class=\"v\">4</span>Praise him with timbrel and choir: praise him with strings and organs.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"5\" data-sid=\"PSA 150:5\" class=\"v\">5</span>Praise him on high sounding cymbals: praise him on cymbals of joy: <span data-number=\"6\" data-sid=\"PSA 150:6\" class=\"v\">6</span>let every spirit praise the Lord. Alleluia.</p>",
